    "detailed_description": "This is a local two-player tank versus tank game where two players control blue and red tanks;<br><br>Players can fire bullets of the same color as their tanks by pressing keys:<br>  -Bullets will bounce around the scene.<br>  -If the bullet hits a player of a different color, it will destroy him.<br>  -If the bullet hits a player of the same color, the player picks up the bullet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/6b4ecbc931397278c623bf4f72af2073.poster.avif?t=1722452363\" width=518 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/6b4ecbc931397278c623bf4f72af2073.webm?t=1722452363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/6b4ecbc931397278c623bf4f72af2073.mp4?t=1722452363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/e968f18b194e066a763221b537d5b519.poster.avif?t=1722452363\" width=518 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/e968f18b194e066a763221b537d5b519.webm?t=1722452363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/e968f18b194e066a763221b537d5b519.mp4?t=1722452363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players have a limited number of bullets, so picking them up and reusing them is the key to winning the game strategically;<br><br>The game has a built-in versus mode and a mini-game mode:<br>  -Battle mode - Classic map: with obstacles and props<br>  -Battle Mode - Walled Maze: Lots of walls for bouncing bullets<br>  -Battle mode - Open space: without any obstacles and props, suitable for pure versus<br>  -Mini-Game - Last Shot: Player has only one bullet and is limited in range of movement. It's like a cowboy duel<br>  -Mini-Game - Soccer match: Simulates a soccer game, players only need to put the ball into the opponent's goal to win!<br>  -Mini-Game - Dangerous balls: A lot of dangerous gray balls visit the scene, players have to pay attention to avoid these dangerous balls!<br><br><strong>The game supports both keyboard and gamepad modes, and if you have two gamepads, it is recommended that you use them to play.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "This is a local two-player tank versus tank game where two players control blue and red tanks;<br><br>Players can fire bullets of the same color as their tanks by pressing keys:<br>  -Bullets will bounce around the scene.<br>  -If the bullet hits a player of a different color, it will destroy him.<br>  -If the bullet hits a player of the same color, the player picks up the bullet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/6b4ecbc931397278c623bf4f72af2073.poster.avif?t=1722452363\" width=518 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/6b4ecbc931397278c623bf4f72af2073.webm?t=1722452363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/6b4ecbc931397278c623bf4f72af2073.mp4?t=1722452363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/e968f18b194e066a763221b537d5b519.poster.avif?t=1722452363\" width=518 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/e968f18b194e066a763221b537d5b519.webm?t=1722452363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107790/extras/e968f18b194e066a763221b537d5b519.mp4?t=1722452363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players have a limited number of bullets, so picking them up and reusing them is the key to winning the game strategically;<br><br>The game has a built-in versus mode and a mini-game mode:<br>  -Battle mode - Classic map: with obstacles and props<br>  -Battle Mode - Walled Maze: Lots of walls for bouncing bullets<br>  -Battle mode - Open space: without any obstacles and props, suitable for pure versus<br>  -Mini-Game - Last Shot: Player has only one bullet and is limited in range of movement. It's like a cowboy duel<br>  -Mini-Game - Soccer match: Simulates a soccer game, players only need to put the ball into the opponent's goal to win!<br>  -Mini-Game - Dangerous balls: A lot of dangerous gray balls visit the scene, players have to pay attention to avoid these dangerous balls!<br><br><strong>The game supports both keyboard and gamepad modes, and if you have two gamepads, it is recommended that you use them to play.</strong>",
